{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo information!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not the final result of the game, also all reached stuff for each characters will be temporary and we're going to wipe data before release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo includes in this specific product:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >basic maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >default outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >default weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >max lvl limit<br><br>What will be in the final version compared to this demo:</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new sounds<br><br>&quot;Help us test the game and prepare for release!&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the heart-pounding action of &quot;Shadows of Soldiers,&quot; an adrenaline-fuelled 8v8 third-person cover-based tactical multiplayer shooter! Prepare to embark on an epic battlefield adventure, where strategic choices and teamwork determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/9d20c4c253b0b673d276a667f941dda3.avif?t=1760691872\" width=1000 height=199 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juggernaut</strong> - Unleash raw power on the battlefield as the mighty Juggernaut. Armed with devastating weaponry and  fortified armor, you're a force to be reckoned with. Crush  <br> your enemies and lead your team to glory.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow</strong> - Become the master of stealth and precision. As a Shadow, you can slip into the darkness, surprising foes with deadly efficiency. Employ your cunning and agility to  <br> outmaneuver enemies and strike from unexpected angles.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander</strong> - Lead your squad to triumph with tactical brilliance and keen strategic insights. The Commander class empowers you with the ability to coordinate your team, call  in powerful support, and seize the battlefield's critical points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/e1ad2d3b4c1cf655ca29bd3fb6315aad.avif?t=1760691872\" width=1000 height=199 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest/Team Death Match    <br>Join the battle in different game modes, each with unique maps with their lore behind it. There are currently 5 unique maps for conquest and 3 for TDM to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/a60dc71712959e4485316c7f569be05d.avif?t=1760691872\" width=1000 height=199 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's environment becomes your greatest ally. Utilize the intricately designed cover system to shield yourself from incoming fire, survey the battlefield, and launch calculated counterattacks.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=478 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/c4e2b05f230aeb0424052b2c093daab5.avif?t=1760691872\" width=1000 height=199 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong>  <br>Customization knows no bounds in &quot;Shadows of Soldiers.&quot; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance</strong> <strong>Customization </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character with a plethora of armor, headgear, and outfits, making your warrior a true reflection of your style and personality.    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.avif?t=1760691872\" data-has-big width=1560 height=839 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use Discord as our primary communication platform. Join to follow our progress, Be first to know our updates or find other like minded players to team up with.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/c8c134644236210b45c33fc6b8adfbd0.avif?t=1760691872\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our YouTube to see the latest developments or watch our streams where the team have discussions and play the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/13053461652dc79122c24c332f3f8d90.avif?t=1760691872\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098590?t=1760691872","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098590?t=1760691872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/02cb94e5da9da9078d228af936b82187106d8c5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760691872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/02cb94e5da9da9078d228af936b82187106d8c5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760691872","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo information!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not the final result of the game, also all reached stuff for each characters will be temporary and we're going to wipe data before release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo includes in this specific product:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >basic maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >default outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >default weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >max lvl limit<br><br>What will be in the final version compared to this demo:</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_para