 in different game modes, each with unique maps with their lore behind it. There are currently 5 unique maps for conquest and 3 for TDM to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/a60dc71712959e4485316c7f569be05d.avif?t=1760691872\" width=1000 height=199 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's environment becomes your greatest ally. Utilize the intricately designed cover system to shield yourself from incoming fire, survey the battlefield, and launch calculated counterattacks.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=478 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/c4e2b05f230aeb0424052b2c093daab5.avif?t=1760691872\" width=1000 height=199 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong>  <br>Customization knows no bounds in &quot;Shadows of Soldiers.&quot; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.poster.avif?t=1760691872\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.webm?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.mp4?t=1760691872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance</strong> <strong>Customization </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character with a plethora of armor, headgear, and outfits, making your warrior a true reflection of your style and personality.    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.avif?t=1760691872\" data-has-big width=1560 height=839 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use Discord as our primary communication platform. Join to follow our progress, Be first to know our updates or find other like minded players to team up with.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/c8c134644236210b45c33fc6b8adfbd0.avif?t=1760691872\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our YouTube to see the latest developments or watch our streams where the team have discussions and play the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098590/extras/13053461652dc79122c24c332f3f8d90.avif?t=1760691872\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p>","developers":["Sneaky Devs"],"ext_user_account_notice":"SoS Account ","fullgame":{"appid":"1401200","name":"Sha